out->imageOffsetsZ[new_gid] = head;
head += delta;
```

The `head` variable is updated by adding `delta`. But `head` starts at `get_size(num_output_glyphs + 1)`. If `delta` is very large, `head` could overflow (wrap around) when adding. But that's a different issue.

